%I A397553 #10 Sep 09 2026 10:58:26
%S A397553 1,2,8,59,1184,84852,23908503,25674654900
%N A397553 Number of nonisomorphic relations on an n-set having the diamond property.
%C A397553 A relation R has the diamond property if xRy and xRz imply that there exists w such that yRw and zRw.
%F A397553 a(n) = Sum_{k=0..n} A396016(k).
%F A397553 a(n) - a(n-1) = A396016(n) for n >= 1.
%e A397553 a(4) = A396016(0) + A396016(1) + A396016(2) + A396016(3) + A396016(4) = 1 + 1 + 6 + 51 + 1125 = 1184.
%Y A397553 Cf. A396016 (nonisomorphic serial relations having the diamond property), A399673 (labeled relations having the diamond property), A398789 (labeled serial relations having the diamond property).
%K A397553 nonn,hard,more,new
%O A397553 0,2
